any changes in kitchen layout during booking. This helps the visit focus on the actual installation and gives the authorised manager a clearer basis for deciding what work to proceed with, rather than relying on a generic repair estimate.</p><p>We receive calls from restaurant kitchens, event caterers and food service businesses across London, including Islington, Enfield, Croydon and Westminster. Urgent enquiries are accepted 24/7; attendance is agreed according to location, equipment suitability and access. Contact 0203 952 4822 with the model information and the number of someone who can review the findings on site. Continue following your kitchen&#x27;s procedures for interrupted refrigeration and affected ingredients. Use the service links above to find information about the exact equipment involved. Completed jobs come with warranty, with the applicable terms and any follow-up recommendations explained so the kitchen team understands the outcome and can keep an accurate service record.</p><h3>Catering site issues and diagnostic context</h3><ul><li>Preparation counters losing cooling: repeated opening, loading and ventilation need considering alongside component faults, especially where the equipment is installed close to cooking appliances or enclosed beneath work surfaces.</li><li>Storage refrigeration alarming overnight: the timing and recorded readings can help distinguish a continuing mechanical problem from symptoms that appear only during the kitchen&#x27;s busiest preparation and service periods.</li><li>Water appearing in work areas: drainage and condensate routes may be concealed behind equipment, so clear access and a description of when the leak appears help guide the inspection.</li><li>Specialist equipment outside the listed services: provide the model before booking so the scope can be confirmed, rather than expecting one visit to cover unrelated appliance systems automatically.</li><li>Access restricted by the kitchen layout: heavy equipment, tight passages or shared service points can affect practical arrangements, making advance coordination useful when the premises must remain operational.</li><li>Recurring faults after earlier work: keep the previous service information available, since the history may explain changes to components or settings that are relevant to the present assessment.</li></ul></div><div class='trust'><div><b>⭐ 500+</b><br>London Businesses</div><div><b>🔧 Same Day</b><br>Fix Rate 92%</div><div><b>📍 All London</b><br>Zones 1-6 Covered</div></div><div class='cta'><h2>LET'S GET IT SORTED 24/7</h2><p>Commercial refrigeration support across London. Call to discuss your fault and arrange an engineer visit.</p><a href='tel:07983759320'>CALL 07983 759320 NOW</a></div><section class="seo-depth" style="max-width:900px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px 8px;line-height:1.7">
