<p>Catering equipment repair on this page is commercial refrigeration and related cold plant in restaurants, hotels, pubs and takeaways. We focus on keeping food storage and ice production working. Domestic kitchen appliances are not repaired. Coverage includes Central London, North London and Greater London hospitality. Tell us the make, model, serial plate, postcode and whether the site is open, in service or closed. Same-day attendance depends on location and workload and is confirmed when you call. ColdDirect does not repair domestic household fridges or freezers.</p>
<p>When you book Catering Equipment Repair London, describe whether the fault started after a delivery, during a hot kitchen service or after a power cut. Those details help the visit. Keep using your own temperature checks and stock procedures until the engineer has finished. All jobs come with warranty on the agreed work. We are commercial specialists only.</p>
